<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Telefonica de Espana.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Telefonica de Espana.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued six million American-style call warrants, on Telefonica de Espana, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3100.00 ESP	     ISS PRICE    436.50 ESP</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   06.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  3160.00 ESP</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
